197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 163 0 R
/T (The project demonstrates the practical implementation of operating system hardening techniques using Windows 11. Various security mechanisms, including Windows Update management, Microsoft Defender configuration, Windows Defender Firewall verification, user account security, NTFS permission analysis, ransomware protection, network security assessment, event logging, and system recovery mechanisms, were implemented and documented.)
/E (The project demonstrates the practical implementation of operating system hardening techniques using Windows 11. Various security mechanisms, including Windows Update management, Microsoft Defender configuration, Windows Defender Firewall verification, user account security, NTFS permission analysis, ransomware protection, network security assessment, event logging, and system recovery mechanisms, were implemented and documented.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
