/P 168 0 R
/E (This project demonstrates how practical operating system hardening can improve the security of a Windows system using built-in security mechanisms. It also provides practical knowledge of Windows administration, PowerShell, endpoint protection, and security monitoring. The techniques implemented in this project can be applied in educational environments, personal computers, and small organizations to improve overall system security.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [21]
>>
